 &lt;p>Sans les deux-points, Python signale une &lt;code>SyntaxError&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>QCM — Variables et affectation</title><link>https://mabemat.github.io/mabemat/snt/seance-01-variables-qcm/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mabemat.github.io/mabemat/snt/seance-01-variables-qcm/</guid><description>&lt;div class="qcm-q" data-correct="1">
 &lt;div class="qcm-question">
 &lt;p>Qu&amp;rsquo;affiche ce programme ?&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f0f0f0;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1&lt;/span>&lt;span>message &lt;span style="color:#666">=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#4070a0">&amp;#34;Bonjour&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#007020">print&lt;/span>(message)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>
 &lt;/div>

 &lt;div class="qcm-opts">
 
 
 
 &lt;div class="qcm-o" data-index="0" onclick="qcmCheck(this)">
 &lt;div class="rd">&lt;/div>
 &lt;span>&lt;code>message&lt;/code>&lt;/span>
 &lt;/div>
 
 
 
 
 &lt;div class="qcm-o" data-index="1" onclick="qcmCheck(this)">
 &lt;div class="rd">&lt;/div>
 &lt;span>&lt;code>Bonjour&lt;/code>&lt;/span>
 &lt;/div>
 
 
 
 
 &lt;div class="qcm-o" data-index="2" onclick="qcmCheck(this)">
 &lt;div class="rd">&lt;/div>
 &lt;span>&lt;code>&amp;quot;Bonjour&amp;quot;&lt;/code>&lt;/span>
 &lt;/div>
 
 
 
 
 &lt;div class="qcm-o" data-index="3" onclick="qcmCheck(this)">
 &lt;div class="rd">&lt;/div>
 &lt;span>Rien&lt;/span>
 &lt;/div>
 
 
 
 &lt;/div>

 &lt;div class="qcm-exp" style="display:none;margin-top:0.8rem;">&lt;/div>
 
